{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此約取信行，係願之緣起也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上四句偈並分行細字，儀賓工布查布所譯之舊文也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按番本，廣演源流、辯正、布壇、置像、設供等例三十餘篇，文甚繁多皆非諷誦者，無庸全譯，今將供壇城\n法開列於後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此諦實勝力，降臨奉坐，勝解想之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拜畢各歸本位，皷吹諸般樂器，且作且誦云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止樂，復誦云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是作七支畢，右膝著地合掌誠念受布薩義云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是誦三遍，已得戒想，更宜記其所戒條目。誦云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是謂淨戒總持，誦七遍或二十一遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是發願"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上乃受大乘布薩法也。受戒畢而觀，作恭敬歡喜之想"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上如常誦之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍或七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虎巢大師云：欲修持者先當竭力自觀無我禪定，斯功既起，由是發四無量心及菩提心，皆為彼無明眾生故。\n此語乃分析因果次第，總以四無量心定之。蓋菩提心與四無量心，二種意本相同也。若專發菩提心者，其說\n具於下文，發明儀軌合大師經義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普賢供雲廣大喜悅者，誦供雲總持，此乃增上大利益，經中所云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍或七遍遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍誦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "供品攝授下奉請諸聖，右膝著地拈花合掌而作是念，所出奉請語句，口誦兼作緣念：「東方去此過四殑河沙\n土，從無勝清淨世界請善名佛！過五𢫈河沙土，從妙寶世界請寶月佛！過六殑河沙土，從充滿妙香世界請金\n色佛！過七殑河沙土，從離憂世界請無憂佛！過八殑河沙土，從法幢世界請法揚佛！過九𢫈河沙土，從寶海世\n界請勝慧佛！過十殑河沙土，從琉璃光明世界請藥師佛等。各同無數眷屬飃然騰空，無礙神通來臨，而作堅固\n\n勝解為大要也。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譬如上師類中則云：奉事勝威德上師戒寶之身某，兼我等；若圓寂則云：願\n彼意念圓滿，兼我等。餘倣此。如大主類中人王則云：奉事極堅金剛之身某，兼我等；若去世則云：願彼意念圓\n滿，兼我等。至大德類中或長老、或出家，如語王義成者則云：奉事語王義成，兼我等；若去世則云：願彼免諸惡\n趣而得解脫，兼我等。如世間類中施主則云：奉事福盛；兼我等；若去世則云：願彼免諸惡趣而得解脫；兼\n我等。其或有名而不知者，如復立法輪寺廟則云：奉事大眾師徒之身，兼我等；如居家類中：施主、福祿、夫婦、子\n嗣與諸眷屬奉事，兼我等。以上諸條略舉大凡，隨時詳為斟酌增減用之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上四節\n分行細字，按番經俱云：「奉事上師戒寶之身……。」蓋舉一以例其餘，恐觀者不明晰，今按舊譯改之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "供養及壇場同前，依諦實力法勝解作也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱期，千萬之數也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "復二偈，乃虎巢大師所補云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此宗派皆我所得授者，因據實書寫，若自已別得師傳，其上師實數一一察出恭敬入之，不可以非己師\n者訛言也，亦不得以己心各自所愛門頭取入，以炫為希有之宗派。蓋世間之大愛者，雖如父母等，諷誦\n時亦不可擅取入也。詳叅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按番經，此節內分行細字與前四節分行細字同，今亦按舊繹改之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦同前，按舊譯改之，以下分行細字，凡有同此者俱按舊譯改之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "復次，龍樹菩薩云四無量禮。如是說者蓋佛境無量、自身變化無量、為利眾生無量、故尋無量手獲得功德無\n量。如《施伊拉拔哈達喇經》中所載四無量。所謂：四無量因意念同也，信解殊勝德水等，具足八功德水波鬘微\n動浪如瓔珞行列無數，自身變化亦如是狀而以奉身；烏闍嘛巴阿喇花、曼達阿喇花、蓮花、烏答巴拉花、\n拔沽拉花等，天上人間雜色妙花盈滿虛空而奉頭上；赤白栴檀、蛇心、沈香、闍嚕嘎香、香麫未番，種種藥草\n焚熏，厚如雲體而以奉鼻；塵器世界而作燈碗，糧油、百草、津液、禾油如海填滿須彌以為燈心，燃燈無邊光明\n能超日月而以奉眼；六香、氷片、栴檀等妙香合和妙藥塗香，如殑河流而奉心間；天龍、鴉嘎剎、人等，諸般熟食\n及未熟食，微妙九品百味食物而以奉舌；籥器、笛、銛子、皷桑、皷等世間音聲盈滿而以奉耳。復又傘蓋、幢\n幡、彩鬘、七珍、八寶、八吉祥等為所供之物，或有真設或作有相，心中多端變化皆有主所拘供養；須彌\n山、金山、遊海、四洲、日月等是無主所拘供養。身或作如意寶；或作寶宮殿；復作役使，隨說成就乃為奉身供\n養。以上雪供誦總持呪力，感如普賢雲供成就者，是為總持供養；於是供養遠離限量不可思議者，是為勝解\n供養。迎請如來同其眷屬乃為依力；昔已造之罪如毒入腹，生極悔心者乃自責之力；從今至於命難而不\n復作者復退過力。如上所說禮供，於勝義中亦無自性，世俗中一切自他之罪障兼我等。如是說時諸佛菩薩\n從心間放大光明，猶如能醫而用嘔吐之藥將病引出，自身淨如水晶，勝信解者乃對治遍行力懺悔自他，一\n切三時所作之善心生歡喜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三千須彌衡時得限量，隨喜功德較彼無限量"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是他善作隨喜者得福平等，\n有此利益太子一切善成，成佛不遠時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓明無為寂滅離緣起，猶如甘露妙法我今得；然雖宣說究亦\n誰能知？故且不語住於山林中。於此示現不說法時，如梵天持千輻輪奉獻祈禱，今即如自手持輪，各隨所化\n界想根基，祈請轉妙法輪。諸佛菩薩為利有情雖六時不遺，但諸有情煩惱熾盛，故心生厭離欲歸於寂者，懇祈\n\n為利眾生永住一刦，不應涅槃。勸請住世，將無邊善法迴向究竟菩提者，《無盡意菩薩請問經》中有長行義，\n有一祕訣師所云：云何廣大？海中一滴水乃至海水不盡是無盡。如是迴向菩提諸善根，乃至不得菩提是不盡，如\n如是善根迴向菩提因者與時無盡，殊特支是也。如是七覺支即同於耕種，秋果熟實，是故勸請勝意。於諸勝\n境處猛力專念：往昔所發勝意，奉求現今我等隨願成就。如是名謂總祈諸勝意成就。奉供因，即禱祝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今時不誦七遍，作易法者甚多，則成增減而大有妨礙，故為剋\n定方好"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供之法亦如上，於此聖會等六支增補誦之，以下悉皆倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此間奉供六支同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句按番文係番地雪嶺，今改為在\n在處處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在府第精舍誦經，師徒改主\n僕，合寺改合府"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一一奉供發願已竟，此間誦總持呪，如作沐浴云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第四兼修總持者，此間觀想攝授總持寶瓶，故為是言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨便多少誦之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此呪宜多誦之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "將瓶水亦浴佛身、或本人及他人而浣洗之，若為亡人則以此水灑其屍上等，有大利益。不\n誣，想之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至此十五偈六十句，同前誦之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以下八偈係虎巢大師所造，或不誦前八偈，誦此八偈亦可"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是奉七支畢，祝云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此吉祥讚三首，各末句作樂，其首者散華米也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T18n0889_p0542b16"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "X59n1080_p0258b16"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n0927_p0054a14"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "T19n0927_p0054c06"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf3", "text": "T19n0927_p0055b07"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n0927_p0058c10"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "T19n0927_p0059a15"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf3", "text": "T19n0927_p0060b15"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n0927_p0058c16"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "T19n0927_p0059b02"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf3", "text": "T19n0927_p0060a03"}
{"id": null, "n": "0048001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0048001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】清道光四年刊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049c1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0049c1001", "type": "add", "text": "己【CB】，已【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050c2501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0050c2501", "type": "add", "text": "拈【CB】，𢫈【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052c1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0052c1001", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052c1002", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0052c1002", "type": "add", "text": "己【CB】，已【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052c1101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0052c1101", "type": "add", "text": "己【CB】，已【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0053c2201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0053c2201", "type": "add", "text": "間【CB】，問【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057a2201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0057a2201", "type": "add", "text": "聞【CB】，問【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060b2001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0060b2001", "type": "add", "text": "師琉【CB】，琉師【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060b2601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0060b2601", "type": "add", "text": "享【CB】，亨【大】"}
